[PrintTextModified Text:于是艾玛一行人迅速解决晚餐后，<br>便前往玛格的牢房。|#0102Adv03_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么玛格要我们去她的房间呢？|#0102Adv03_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格和奈叶香是住在一起的……<br>说不定和这件事有关。|#0102Adv03_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说起来，玛格的房间<br>一直是被围挡住的。|#0102Adv03_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格和奈叶香的房间在艾玛的隔壁。|#0102Adv03_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（说起来，我从没见过玛格她们的房间<br>　里面长什么样子）|#0102Adv03_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（印象中，她们的房间<br>　被一块不知哪里找来的窗帘布遮挡了起来）|#0102Adv03_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:三人来到玛格的牢房前。<br>不出所料，门前挂了块布，看不见里面的样子。|#0102Adv03_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格，你在吗？|#0102Adv03_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小心翼翼地问道，<br>随后便听见里面传来了声音。|#0102Adv03_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：カーテン越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:欢迎光临。<br>门开着，请进吧。|#0102Adv03_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 衣ずれの音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_41 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们掀起帘子，<br>走进房间。|#0102Adv03_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:1.5 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,50 AppearanceAndTransition:100_1 SubId:Middle
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.8 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@WaitForNextFrame

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:30 ScenePositionY:50 Duration:30
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

[PrintTextModified Text:哦……|#0102Adv03_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哇……|#0102Adv03_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这、这、这是怎么一回事！？|#0102Adv03_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:整个牢房四周都挂满了帘子，<br>仿佛摇身一变，成了一座占卜馆。|#0102Adv03_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在房间的中央，玛格正把手肘支在桌上<br>向她们投来妖艳的微笑。|#0102Adv03_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不好意思，这里空间太小了。|#0102Adv03_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这些是你用魔法变出来的吗？<br>变化大得太夸张了。|#0102Adv03_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵，不是哦。毕竟我们有大把的时间，<br>所以我就把这里改造得更宜居了一些。|#0102Adv03_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我从很久以前就开始出于爱好做占卜了。<br>说是爱好，其实也算在做生意吧？<br>因为我也喜欢赚钱。|#0102Adv03_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你到底是怎么做到的……|#0102Adv03_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只是借用了监牢里的东西。<br>这其实很简单，你们不如也试试看吧？|#0102Adv03_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你把我们叫来<br>就是为了让我们看这个房间吗？|#0102Adv03_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这也是原因之一。还有就是……<br>我很警惕监控摄像头。|#0102Adv03_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:什么！？<br>这里设置了监控摄像头吗！？|#0102Adv03_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0.8 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:100_1 SubId:Front
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格摇了摇头。|#0102Adv03_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我和奈叶香在监牢里分头搜寻了好几天，<br>但哪里都没有找到装监控摄像头的痕迹。|#0102Adv03_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，既然我们被当作囚犯抓到这里，<br>最好还是随时做好被监视的心理准备。|#0102Adv03_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从过道那边是看不见这里的，<br>要商量机密事情的话，来这个房间就好。|#0102Adv03_Margo009| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（原来玛格叫我们来是为了这件事……<br>　她比我想像中要亲切呢）|#0102Adv03_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:先不说这个……大家都说<br>我的占卜可是很准的哦。|#0102Adv03_Margo010| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText


[PrintTextModified Text:有兴趣的话我也可以给你们占卜哦♡<br>当然是付费的。呵呵呵♡|#0102Adv03_Margo011| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（收回前言……！<br>　她要开始推销了……！）|#0102Adv03_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]







@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:2
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:对于玛格的占卜，艾玛她——|#0102Adv03_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

