# Choice1-2-1

@RecordCorrectChoice Number:9

[PrintTextModified Text:理所当然地拒绝了。|#0102Adv03_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
@Gosub Path:.fortune
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一行人好不容易逃脱了玛格的占卜推销，<br>精疲力竭地离开了房间。|#0102Adv03_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:刚、刚才真是太可怕了……<br>她居然说没有钱就用身体来支付……|#0102Adv03_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要是点头同意的话，<br>肯定要被她慢慢压榨到什么都不剩……|#0102Adv03_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉突然一下子想起来了。|#0102Adv03_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:不对，<br>我们完全没制定越狱计划吧！？|#0102Adv03_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:放风时间马上要结束了哦！？|#0102Adv03_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不过我们得知了更多情报，<br>比如监牢里没有装监控摄像头之类的……！|#0102Adv03_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明天再认真制定计划吧！！|#0102Adv03_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:三人迈着无力的步伐走在过道上。|#0102Adv03_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……不过，也许玛格的生存方式<br>是最合理的。|#0102Adv03_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你的意思是？|#0102Adv03_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:精神压力积攒得越多，就会越容易魔女化。<br>既然如此，那不要让自己有压力就好了。|#0102Adv03_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我看玛格她<br>还是和先前一样，活得自由自在的，<br>不像会变成魔女的样子。|#0102Adv03_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:确实……|#0102Adv03_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（而我们一直过着<br>　压力巨大的生活……）|#0102Adv03_Ema013|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不快、焦躁、恐惧、愤怒。<br>种种负面情绪一点一滴地萦绕在艾玛她们的心里。|#0102Adv03_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（魔女化的程度越深，杀意也就越重……<br>　那我们——）|#0102Adv03_Ema014|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:在这里度过的时间越久，魔女化的程度就会越深。<br>也许正因为如此，<br>奈叶香才会说我们没有时间了……|#0102Adv03_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊。<br>而杀意变重的奈叶香<br>现在行踪不明。|#0102Adv03_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:或许下次再现身时，<br>她已经成了杀人犯。|#0102Adv03_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜顿时面色苍白，不停地在发抖。|#0102Adv03_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么会这样……她还带着那么吓人的枪，<br>谁能抵抗得了她……|#0102Adv03_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:我们也有反击的办法。<br>一旦发现她，立刻把她打倒就行！|#0102Adv03_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:雪、雪莉，你在说什么啊！？|#0102Adv03_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR7

[PrintTextModified Text:……咦？<br>我说得不对吗……？|#0102Adv03_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要是变成了魔女的话，她就不会轻易死掉了，<br>只是反击一下又不至于杀死它，应该没事啦。|#0102Adv03_Sherry013| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哪怕对手是魔女，<br>让它暂时不能行动，我们还是能做到的吧？|#0102Adv03_Sherry014| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:奈叶香不一定已经魔女化了。<br>她可能只是心态变悲观了。|#0102Adv03_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR7

[PrintTextModified Text:说得也是，等我们拿到确凿的证据再说反击的事吧。<br>欸嘿，我以后会注意的！|#0102Adv03_Sherry015| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（雪莉……偶尔会说些可怕的话呢……）|#0102Adv03_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛很担心奈叶香，<br>但并没有收到发现她的报告。|#0102Adv03_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（奈叶香说，<br>　她用幻视魔法得知了这座监牢的情报）|#0102Adv03_Ema019|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（就算她知道其他人都不知道的藏身处<br>　也不奇怪）|#0102Adv03_Ema020|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（但是，她真的能连着好几天躲过<br>　典狱长和看守的监视吗……？）|#0102Adv03_Ema021|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:至少，艾玛她们正处在<br>被监视的情况下，只能老实去遵守明文规定。|#0102Adv03_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:今天典狱长的通知也该来了。|#0102Adv03_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:最后，艾玛她们还是只能遵守规定<br>回到自己的牢房。|#0102Adv03_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

